 Z←Caption Sky;LAT;LONG;STATEDDAYNO;STATEDTIME;MDY;M;D;Y;LATD;LATM;NS;LONGD;LONGM;EW;DN;H;AP;LINE
⍝ Header line matching book example:
⍝ VIEW FROM {lat} NORTH, {long} WEST, ON {day} {date} AT {time}
 LAT LONG STATEDDAYNO STATEDTIME←Sky.(Lat Long StatedDayNo StatedTime)
 MDY←JNUINV STATEDDAYNO
 M←MDY[1] ⋄ D←MDY[2] ⋄ Y←MDY[3]
 DN←DAYNAME STATEDDAYNO
 ⍝ Latitude: degrees and arcminutes
 LATD←⌊|LAT
 LATM←⌊0.5+60×(|LAT)-LATD
 NS←(1+LAT<0)⊃'NORTH' 'SOUTH'
 ⍝ Longitude: degrees and arcminutes
 LONGD←⌊|LONG
 LONGM←⌊0.5+60×(|LONG)-LONGD
 EW←(1+LONG>0)⊃'WEST' 'EAST'
 ⍝ Time: hours → 12-hour with AM/PM
 H←12|STATEDTIME
 :If H=0 ⋄ H←12 ⋄ :EndIf
 AP←(1+STATEDTIME<12)⊃'PM' 'AM'
 ⍝ Assemble
 LINE←'VIEW FROM ',(⍕LATD),' DEGREES ',(⍕LATM),' MINUTES ',NS
 LINE←LINE,', ',(⍕LONGD),' DEGREES ',(⍕LONGM),' MINUTES ',EW
 LINE←LINE,', ON ',DN,' ',(⍕Y),'/',(⍕M),'/',(⍕D)
 LINE←LINE,' AT ',(⍕⌊H),' ',(¯2↑'0',⍕⌊0.5+60×H-⌊H),' ',AP
 Z←,⊂LINE
